aybe introduce them to  each other in your other hand I want you  to imagine the future  these could be your children or  grandchildren it could be people that  you have mentored or will mentor it  could be the people that you hope will  lead our country and institutions in the  future in your two hands in you you  always have both the past and the future  this is your timeline complete hands  down the historian leader learns from  the past to make a better future to be a  historian later use the timeline as a  tool to remember where you came from to  remember where you're going and to go go  there boldly and I will see you in the  history books thank you  [Applause]  [Music]  Oh

